{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39695","headline":"寄越从事林嵩侍御 · 黄滔","name":"寄越从事林嵩侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"子虚词赋动君王，谁不期君入对敭。\n莫恋兔园留看雪，已乘骢马合凌霜。\n路归天上行方别，道在人间久便香。\n应念都城旧吟客，十年踪迹委沧浪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39695.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39695","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}